---
description: TILA Mongo naming and repository boundaries
alwaysApply: true
---

When adding or changing Mongo collections, fields, or closed-set values, follow `docs/persistence.md`.

- Collection names and document fields: `camelCase`.
- Closed-set values: `SCREAMING_SNAKE` in Mongo and JSON.
- Only repositories access Mongo. Apps, controllers, and the SPA do not.
- User-owned queries always filter by `userId` from the authenticated principal.
- Update `docs/collections/README.md` when adding a collection or index.
